# Model routing

Classify the request, then match the chat model before writing code.

- Small UI edits, colors, settings, isolated fixes: Grok 4.7, Low–Medium effort, default context.
- Features, animation fixes, combat changes: Opus 5.5 High, default context.
- World editor, multiplayer, major inventory changes: Opus 5.5 High, default context. Escalate only if that pass fails.
- A problem Opus has already failed to resolve: Fable 5.1 High. Expand context only for that pass.

If this chat is on a lighter model than the row requires, stop and ask for the switch. Do not implement that work here.

Stay on the current model when it already matches. Do not expand context unless the row says to.
